{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55267","headline":"宿弹琴张处士所居 · 龚霖","name":"宿弹琴张处士所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君鼓七丝，□我暂忘机。\n莫谓知音少，都缘能□稀。\n无风过竹槛，有月照柴扉。\n一弄一杯酒，坐来霜□衣。\n（同前第三五○四页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"龚霖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}